    "text": "Section VI., EXLCUSIONS, of this Policy is hereby amended by addition of the following: Products Liability “Claims”, “remediation costs\" or “legal defense expense” arising out of any goods or products manufactured, sold or distributed by an “insured”. This exclusion shall not apply to “product pollution”, subject to the Sublimits of Liability identified on this Endorsement above and/or the Limits or Aggregate Limits of Liability identified in the Declarations to this Policy."
  },
  {
    "id": "c187",
    "name": "Endorsement 13 — Product Pollution",
    "text": "IV. Section V., DEFINTIONS, of this Policy is hereby amended by addition of the following: “Product Pollution” means a “pollution condition” which arises out of the use of a product sold, manufactured, handled, or distributed by the “insured”, provided that such use occurs after the MANU 2 (11/11) © 2011 ited Page 1 of 2 “insured” has relinquished possession of the product. For the purposes of this Policy, products do not include waste products."
