  {
    "id": "c192",
    "name": "Endorsement 15 — Submission to Jurisdiction",
    "text": "If the insured requests, the company will submit to the jurisdiction of any court of competent jurisdiction. The company will accept the final decision of that court or any Appellate Court in the event of an appeal."
