  {"clause_id": "c175", "issues": [
    {"issue": "This is a third replacement of Definition V.F., and it limits non-owned disposal site coverage to sites on a \"Schedule of Non-Owned Disposal Sites Endorsement\" that is not attached, contradicting Endorsement 8's blanket inclusion of any non-owned disposal site. Which definition of \"covered location\" controls is a direct conflict.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.30}
